          "en": "Meta is attempting to revitalize its AI efforts with new open models after trailing competitors, as Mark Zuckerberg indicates a path forward.",
          "zh": "在落后于竞争对手之后，Meta正试图通过新的开放模型来重振其人工智能业务，马克·扎克伯格表示已找到前进方向。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The current strategic direction for Meta's AI endeavors involves the deployment of \"new open models.\"",
            "This move signifies \"another reboot\" of Meta's long-term \"struggling AI strategy.\"",
            "The motivation for this strategic adjustment stems from Meta \"trailing competitors\" in the AI sector."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Meta当前的人工智能战略方向涉及部署“新的开放模型”。",
            "此举标志着Meta长期“挣扎中的人工智能战略”的“再次重启”。",
            "这一战略调整的动机源于Meta在人工智能领域“落后于竞争对手”的现状。"
          ]
